{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_043_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:72045cbf83651d81e82a27e5fb67dcc32466da8c92a028762dc5c7fb857bb401",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bf04991270b6beb847871472d889857795a500419bbb6931a257040f95ed7ab",
      "text": "……是情人节巧克力啊。\n●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e07d8b8764945d94723881fa474f6307b280fcaa30e3bf50160f7612b39ecba1",
      "text": "……因为想搭配着饮品一起细细品味，\n我等会儿再吃吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ac3af5d36e3c470ca99120f2b8abe597bf349f74d2f28cf6d1c53ac2117080e",
      "text": "……去想象里面装着怎样的巧克力，\n本身也是一件很快乐的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5a2ddfbabd8e59c8d22c29500d88f652e41a174e9d89115436c70a3b5436ec5",
      "text": "……而且，这盒巧克力里想必也倾注了制作人的Passion\n吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b2dd43953a858aa5a40fe0ba8a17554661131de05dcedff9299a80238927f87",
      "text": "……从现在起就很期待拆开了。\n谢谢你送我这么棒的礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0d0e12265a78f870aeb36955585d557ee9241300c0697bfc09c82e32d626bff",
      "text": "……谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。\n情人节巧克力，我真的很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:011ac65668b7ae03b632fb710bde6894a3ff15c29ce466272b8bcf919c8943ba",
      "text": "……早知如此我也该准备些什么才好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dfc927ffcd56834116cde4e6b0c7bd42e28873e0addb7eb227f530195c2d8f8",
      "text": "……毕竟在海外，也有些国家是会互相交换礼物的呢。\n我竟然一时疏忽了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7801688aebec9d6cf5594165a62e1afcd8489c9a5b8b4e5693644b645ae3e0a",
      "text": "只要有这份心意就足够了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cae7497d0d6dd06c8491499594437ede0c98dcf80ebd0cc672d2d973c10ced4b",
      "text": "光是能听您这么说，我就很高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05ac2382e15a0b8f2a46d1ae0c8cd60a7d4b23dc72bac764c24c271849a1758c",
      "text": "……真像制作人会有的回答呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37e370d4220ddccaa7a2cd9f605f75b2fb5fc2ef3ec98355b6d4257fe5434ef1",
      "text": "……既然这样，这次没能准备上的份，\n就留到白色情人节奉还吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65d2929b2ba437539d5cfaae53c95d1ea24e01f81672d8ab607fd066db9ebdca",
      "text": "……我也想让制作人，\n体会到与现在的我同样的心情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db23dd8d74245a679c6d51cdfeba95fa5d82f1f1ba1fc58a077f349cf6c0ef4b",
      "text": "……当天还请好好期待着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000047:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb37d19425cb8c7e87df3511358a816cdb59574adc56cf4016f01c737ff15f6e",
      "text": "好的！我很期待",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_043_22:5_01_043_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7512d263abc57e5411cc932007505735b770d176d5d66060e8674bf7aa5ff2f1",
      "text": "……嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
